														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1332693">
									

<p>Well that is a fantastic start to my morning. Fed a man his retina indeed. I'm glad I skipped breakfast.</p>
<p>The only thing that caught me as out of place was &quot;Did I fucking stutter&#8230;&quot;, because it made me think Pulp Fiction. When I'm reading and get pulled out of the story wondering if the speaker is making a pop culture reference, it degrades the impact of her threat. I'd consider changing it just so the reader can stay focused on the progression.</p>
<p>But that is an incredibly minor quibble over a great story. :)</p>

							</div>

								
					
