															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-gears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(172464); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=172464&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608349718" alt="Dr Gears" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=172464)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-gears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(172464); return false;" >Dr Gears</a></span> <span class="odate time_1324499010 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">21 Dec 2011 20:23</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1332889">
									

<p>With the little freak out she undergoes&#8230;the issue is, the Black Queen is a twisted genius on par with any over-elaborate bond villan&#8230;at the same time, she's also unstable, violent, homicidal and sadistic. She's spent a massive chunk of her life preparing for her revenge&#8230;and it's eaten away at her, even as it's refined her in to something very keen and bright.</p>
<p>Ideally, what i get across is someone who could be a wicked mastermind villein&#8230;were it not for the serial killer undertones. Because she's doing it to the various Foundation universe groups, it's more accepted&#8230;but if she wasn't, she'd be on the news nightly. What's more&#8230;it's not clear if she can just suddenly &quot;stop&quot; now, or slow down&#8230;she may have crossed a mental rubicon that there's no crossing back from.</p>
<p>The studder bit might be better re-tweaked&#8230;i'll see if i can find a better outburst&#8230;</p>

							</div>

								
					
